{"text": "The day came. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the arena was filled. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With thousands of people. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The young man walked in tall and handsome. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And bowed to the king. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But his eyes went straight. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To the princess. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who sat at her fathers right side. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With gold. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the power of her will the princess had learned. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The secret of the doors. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She knew. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In which room the tiger waited. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And in which room the lady stood. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She also knew. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who the lady was and she hated her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had seen that lady. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Look at the young man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With admiring eyes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sometimes she thought. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had looked back at her too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her jealous heart. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Burned with hatred. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For that beautiful lady. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The young man looked at her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And he understood at once. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That she knew the secret.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "d", "a", "y", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "a", "r", "e", "n", "a", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "f", "i", "l", "l", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "i", "t", "h", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "s", "a", "n", "d", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "